<title>LATVIA: STABURADZE UP, LIEPAJA OIL DOWN ON QUIET BOURSE.</title>
<headline>STABURADZE UP, LIEPAJA OIL DOWN ON QUIET BOURSE.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1997-07-02</dateline>
<text>
